# Apixaban + Explicit 4x DMSO: r2SCAN-3c SinglePoint (KeepDens) on the
#   XTB2-optimized structure
# Starting geometry: the converged XTB2 Opt result of
#   Apixaban_Explicit4DMSO_XTB2_Opt.out (E_XTB2 = -155.788358 Eh; fully
#   converged, no warnings), which was itself the XTB2 re-optimization of
#   the r2SCAN-3c/SMD(DMSO)-optimized Explicit4 structure
#   (Apixaban_Explicit4DMSO_repositioned_SMD_DMSO_Opt_KeepDens.out,
#   E_r2SCAN-3c = -3754.770760516310 Eh).
#
# Purpose: evaluate the r2SCAN-3c electronic energy (and density, via
#   KeepDens) at the XTB2-relaxed geometry, without re-optimizing at the DFT
#   level - lets the two levels of theory (r2SCAN-3c-optimized vs
#   XTB2-optimized geometry) be compared directly at the r2SCAN-3c energy
#   level.
#
# No SMD/solvent model here, matching the other gas-phase-style single
#   points used in this project for Explicit-solvent structures (e.g.
#   Apixaban/DMSO/MD/10/XTB2Opt/Apixaban_10DMSO_r2SCAN3c_SinglePoint_KeepDens.inp).

! r2SCAN-3c TightSCF KeepDens

%pal
  nprocs 4
end

%maxcore 2000

